<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Hyderadad To Blue Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a typical move from Hyderadad to Blue take for household goods?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A standard intercity shift covering the 850 km corridor between Hyderadad and Blue usually completes in 12‑16 hours of road time, depending on traffic, weather, and checkpoint clearances. Shree Ashirwad schedules dedicated container trucks, so customers can expect door‑to‑door delivery within 1‑2 business days, including loading and unloading.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to initiate a kphb colony hyderadad to blue dart relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Clients must provide a valid government‑issued ID, address proof for both origin and destination, a signed packing list, and a GST‑compliant invoice if the move is for corporate reimbursement. For vehicle transport, registration certificate and insurance papers are also needed. All paperwork is verified before dispatch.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the cargo fully insured during the Hyderadad‑Blue transit and what does the coverage include?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every shipment is covered by a 100 % declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. The policy protects against loss, theft, accidental damage, and natural calamities throughout the journey. Customers receive an insurance certificate at the time of booking, and claims are processed within 7 business days if required.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are delicate items such as glassware, temple idols, or electronics packed for the long‑haul move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Delicate articles are wrapped in high‑density 80‑GSM bubble wrap, secured with foam edge protectors, and placed between multi‑ply corrugated sheets. A stretch‑film layer adds weatherproofing, and for extra security, custom wooden crates are built around the most fragile pieces. The 7‑layer system ensures shock absorption across the 850 km route.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time while it travels from Hyderadad to Blue?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Each container truck is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to our customer portal. Clients receive a unique tracking ID and can monitor progress, estimated arrival time, and any checkpoint stops directly from their smartphone or desktop.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What payment methods are accepted and do you handle corporate reimbursement claims?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We accept cash, bank transfers, credit/debit cards, and digital wallets. For corporate clients, we issue GST‑compliant invoices that can be submitted for Central/State Government, PSU, or private company reimbursement. Our finance team assists with claim documentation to ensure a smooth reimbursement process.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any items that cannot be moved on the Hyderadad‑Blue highway corridor?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, hazardous materials such as flammable liquids, explosives, and compressed gases are prohibited. Additionally, perishable food items without proper cold‑chain packaging, live animals, and unregistered firearms cannot be transported. Our team will review the inventory list and advise on any restricted goods before loading.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
